cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Leakage-Controlled Dynamic Comparator Using 45nm CMOS"
message: "Please cite this project when referencing the repository or its reported results."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Macharla
    given-names: Sai
date-released: 2026-08-12
abstract: >
  Design and analysis of a low-power, high-speed leakage-controlled
  double-tail dynamic comparator using the LECTOR technique in 45nm CMOS
  for ADC applications. The design was implemented and simulated using
  Cadence Virtuoso/Spectre.
